# All Products Add Product modal

One modal (`app/admin/products/page.tsx`). **Category** switches the field set. A paste that shows Stickers, Letter 20 g, label pack, Black color, sheet quantity **is Stickers**, not Market S.

New product starts with **empty** category. Shipping box still shows (anything except HotGoods). Pick **Market S** to hide sticker-only blocks.

## Stickers (the dump you saw)

| Field | Needed? | What it drives |
|----|---|---|
| Name, price, original price, image, in stock, descriptions | Yes | Catalog / listing / PDP |
| Category = Stickers | Yes | Unlocks sticker fields |
| Shipping class Letter + ~20 g | **Yes for stickers** | Checkout letter vs parcel. Unlike Market S, this is not auto from subcategory |
| Subcategory * | **Yes** | CMS active `subcategoryItems` (Basic, Premium, Bespoke, Stationery, Mixed Labels, …). Real `/stickers/[slug]` pages — **not** shipping class |
| Enable label pack options | Yes for **grid name labels** | Customize-page pack sizes; list price = lowest pack. Hidden for Set / Mixed Labels / Stationery |
| Size (Small / Medium mm / Round / Custom) | Yes for name labels | Sheet grid via `stickerPresetForAdminForm` (“24 labels per sheet”) |
| Material (Vinyl / Paper / PP) | Optional merch | Stored on SKU; not a Market S field |
| Color = Black only | Locked | Always saved as `Black`; dropdown is not a real choice |
| Sticker sheet quantity = 3 | Yes when pack options **off** | Default 3-sheet price. Hidden if pack options on, Mixed Labels, or Stationery |
| Customization Options | Yes for name / custom stickers | Customer text/color/size/image on customize |
| Fallback image | Only if the primary file is a **video** | ProductGallery poster. Still photos do not need it |
| Stock / safety / incoming, rating, reviews, New / Best Seller / Limited, detail page | Shared merchandising | Same as other categories |
| AI image / AI copy | Optional HITL | Apply then Save; does not auto-publish |

**Subcategory empty still counts as grid name label** (`subcategory !== 'Set'`), so pack-options UI can appear before Basic/Premium is chosen.

### Sticker subcategory cousins (do not mix with Market S)

| Subcategory | Extra UI |
|----|---|
| Basic / Premium / Kids / Office / Custom (grid name) | Size + pack options + sheet qty or packs |
| Set | Set item count; no pack options |
| Mixed Labels | Sheet bundles + name length; no pack options |
| Stationery Essentials | Free-text size; image customization; no sheet qty |

## Market S (HotGoods) — different modal state

After Category = Market S: **no** shipping box, **no** pack options, **no** color/material/fallback/customization. Subcategory is only **Single Item / Family Bundle** (shipping pack class). See `market-s-subcategory-fields.mdc`.

## Do not

- Treat this Stickers dump as proof Market S fields came back.
- Delete sticker shipping / size / pack / customization “because Market S hid them”.
- Add Sunscreen-style merch rows to Market S because Stickers CMS subcategories exist.
- Assume empty Category + shipping box means Stickers is the default save target — category is still required.
